		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Colossal, 60-foot-tall figure made from a pile of living humanoid bodies. Can split into smaller flesh-figures.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 78, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 slam (near) +8 (2d10) or 1 stomp (near) +8 (4d12), <strong>MV</strong> double near, <strong>S</strong> +6, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +6, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 16</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Antimagic Aura</strong>. A near-sized cube centered on colossus that cancels hostile spells targeting anyone inside the aura.</p><p></p><p><strong>Colossus</strong>. Immune to damage from electricity or non-magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Split</strong>. As an action, split into three flesh golems (divide remaining HP between golems, no immunities). Can rejoin given 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
